<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder &amp; Co said Wednesday it downgraded Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc to perform in line from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Anheuser-Busch is due to report second quarter earnings today.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 2 to 45-7/8.</p>
</text>
